IMAPAccount protonmail
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 1143
User arbn@arbn.nyc
PassCmd "gpg -q --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty -d ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk 'FNR == 2 {print $8}'"
SSLType STARTTLS
SSLVersions TLSv1.2
CertificateFile ~/.config/protonmail/bridge/cert.pem

IMAPStore remote
Account protonmail

#You can change .mail to something else
MaildirStore local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX/

Channel inbox
Master :remote:
Slave :local:
Patterns * 
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Group protonmail
Channel inbox
